cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these toolkits or derived corpora in your research, please cite this repository (and the specific kit) as below."
title: "TEXTUAL-PAPER-KIT: reusable textual-data toolkits for Chinese listed-firm research"
abstract: >-
  A collection of self-contained Python toolkits that turn Chinese listed-firm
  disclosures into research-ready datasets: downloading filings from CNINFO,
  reconstructing PDF layout or chapter structure, extracting structured fields,
  and storing them in SQLite with FTS5 for export to CSV, Stata, or Excel.
  Includes annual_report_mda_kit (annual-report MD&A sections, Apache-2.0) and
  audit_engagement_kit (auditor engagement notices, MIT).
authors:
  - name: "TEXTUAL-PAPER-KIT contributors"
type: software
version: "0.1.0"
date-released: "2026-11-04"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Relipd/TEXTUAL-PAPER-KIT"
keywords:
  - textual analysis
  - Chinese listed firms
  - annual report
  - MD&A
  - auditor engagement
  - CNINFO
  - PDF layout extraction
  - corpus
  - Python
